  "checks": [
    "Named profile requires exact H plus reviewed runtime and Boolean/stability bodies; default remains distinct and unchanged.",
    "Boolean first-argument handling retains staged demand and non-Boolean fallback.",
    "Stability cache publishes only completed Boolean facts over immutable terms and is independent of book/context.",
    "Fresh host-owned graph encoding and API-specific validated Base-cache identities remain in use.",
    "Lexical-block functions retain closures; only module-level eligible generated workers are hoisted.",
    "Data-only worker transport, consumed-read audits and verified publication preserve the private boundary.",
    "Book-final selection retains last-definition/order/done semantics and malformed-name legacy fallback.",
    "Telescope reuse is limited by the conservative substitution fact and literal All traversal; ordinary normalization resumes at other heads."
  ],
